/ An event bound after %count% is set runs after each set of the variable %count%, not of its value.
Start
- set %count% = 0
- set %runs% = 0
- after %count% is set, call Log
- set %count% = 1
- set %count% = 2
- assert %runs% equals 2, "Log ran after each set"

/ The event's call.
Log
- add 1 to %runs%, write to %runs%
